  "description": "The function of this message is to respond to an OMG message.  An ORG message is the application acknowledgment to an OMG message. \n\nIn ORG the PID and ORC segments are optional, particularly in case of an error response.  However, ORC segments are always required in ORG when the OBR is present.  For example, a response ORG might include only the MSH and MSA.",
